  "stac_version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "\nThe Land Use and Coverage Area frame Survey (LUCAS) data set provides a unique\ndata source to expand machine learning segmentation algorithms within the \ncontext of land-use and land-cover change, as well as biodiversity measurements.\nHere, we provide an analysis-ready dataset of segmented LUCAS survey photos and\nancillary information and summary statistics, in support of land-use and \nland-cover change validation, vegetation detection and characterization \nas well as biodiversity and landscape heterogeneity monitoring.\n",
